\title{FLBacktest: Backtest Management Strategy Evaluation for FLR}
\description{
Conducts retrospective (backtest) Management Strategy Evaluation for fisheries managed under harvest control rules. Provides S4 generic methods for closed-loop HCR feedback, short-cut and full observation models, retrospective bias, SAM indices, and reusable conditioning helpers (HCR parameters, Lorenzén M, recruitment deviations, OM uncertainty) for use by applications.

Retrospective Management Strategy Evaluation via S4 generic methods that
applications can reuse. The design follows the short-cut versus full-MP
backtest workflow.
}
